{
  "name": "LinkedIn Prospect Recent Posts Scraper for AI Cold Email Icebreakers",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ LinkedIn Prospect Recent Posts Scraper for AI Cold Email Icebreakers\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nFetch a prospect’s latest LinkedIn posts before sending an outbound sequence so GPT-4o/Claude can write hyper-personalized first lines.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-posts-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-posts-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Profile Posts Scraper (No Cookies)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "543622cd-f2cc-4649-a9b1-9c4b7a86e3a8",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **LinkedIn Profile Posts Scraper (No Cookies)** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "4fcbf235-47e6-400e-ad9f-c56143d44c04",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "3c958e05-4800-4486-a25f-886a264e45cf",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
